{
  "title": "About New Plugin",
  "plugin": "new",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "og3wn3fj",
      "text": "Palette controls the plugin picker by curating which plugins are available at each skill level. Place a new item on your welcome page and click a level button \u2014 the factory menu updates immediately and the choice persists across page loads."
    },
    {
      "type": "new",
      "id": "v3gtuz4c",
      "text": "LEVEL NUBE\nParagraph\nMarkdown\nImage\nVideo\nReference\n\nLEVEL AUTHOR\nParagraph\nMarkdown\nImage\nVideo\nReference\nCode\nHTML\nDate\nTimeline\nFamily\n\nLEVEL EXPERT\nALL\n\nLEVEL GEEK\nALL\n\nHIDE\nMath\nTransport\nRostermatic\nMech\nSolo\nUser Access Tokens"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "ipvrtpq9",
      "text": "## DSL"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gnr8imi0",
      "text": "Each `LEVEL` block names a skill tier and lists the plugins available at that tier \u2014 one plugin name per line, matching the name in its `factory.json`. `ALL` means every installed plugin. The `HIDE` block removes plugins from all levels regardless of tier."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "u58mcrci",
      "text": "LEVEL NUBE\nParagraph\nMarkdown\nImage\nVideo"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "cemjfu4i",
      "text": "LEVEL GEEK\nALL\n\nHIDE\nMath\nTransport"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xto57b09",
      "text": "Levels: `NUBE` \u2014 newcomer basics. `AUTHOR` \u2014 content creator. `EXPERT` \u2014 most plugins. `GEEK` \u2014 everything (minus HIDE list). The active level is stored in `localStorage` so it survives page navigation."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "r1vqmrlt",
      "text": "## Repositories"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
